{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/Image1.png?t=1745833510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPEED IS YOUR ONLY SURVIVAL</strong><br><br>You are M0M-3N7 \u2014 an experimental reconnaissance robot awakened decades after a disaster in a vast underground research complex. Designed to move constantly, your kinetic energy is the only thing keeping you alive. Stop \u2014 and your core collapses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accelerate through malfunctioning test chambers, collapsed laboratories, and surreal, physics-defying zones near the Core. Use boosters, and precise timing to build momentum and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the more unstable the world becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the truth behind the Q-STAR project, the collapse of the facility, and the origin of your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a fan of fast-paced, skill-heavy platformers with a strong sci-fi atmosphere like <i>Celeste</i>, <i>Dead Cells</i>, or <i>Katana Zero</i>, <strong>Momentum</strong> brings you heart-pounding movement, environmental storytelling, and a haunting descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1745833510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1745833510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1745833510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast, </strong>momentum-driven platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Movement is survival </strong>\u2014<strong> </strong>stopping is death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric sci-fi world </strong>with environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-defying levels </strong>and<strong> </strong>kinetic challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656340?t=1745833510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/1f9050ecb13424eb1f1dee9d3d7fc29651ae6d65/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745833510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/bbebc3a5cb6938db96e029b5c44390bbd73e91e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745833510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/bbebc3a5cb6938db96e029b5c44390bbd73e91e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745833510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/Image1.png?t=1745833510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPEED IS YOUR ONLY SURVIVAL</strong><br><br>You are M0M-3N7 \u2014 an experimental reconnaissance robot awakened decades after a disaster in a vast underground research complex. Designed to move constantly, your kinetic energy is the only thing keeping you alive. Stop \u2014 and your core collapses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accelerate through malfunctioning test chambers, collapsed laboratories, and surreal, physics-defying zones near the Core. Use boosters, and precise timing to build momentum and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the more unstable the world becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">